; An 8-bit counter that steps by 0x11 and an input that copies it, so that
; every solver gives the same values, which Z3 prints in hexadecimal.
1 sort bitvec 8
2 sort bitvec 1
3 zero 1
4 constd 1 17
5 constd 1 85
6 input 1 in
7 state 1 count
8 init 1 7 3
9 add 1 7 4
10 next 1 7 9
11 eq 2 6 7
12 constraint 11
13 eq 2 7 5
14 bad 13
